        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The pie charts show people&rsquo;s reasons for immigration to a European country in 2009 and reasons for emigration from a European country in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Immigration &amp; Emigration Reasons: 2009</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/KSzQQm4x1Sk?si=Hd6Lg_bTG-GTzwoT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề + Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSfZdFZOWo4qLSxeFS1lCO9Wggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-InHCdAqbEoSbtExAER7lOWo0gwg\">Đề b&agrave;i Immigration &amp; Emigration Reasons: 2009 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả 2 pie charts về l&yacute; do di cư&nbsp;<strong>v&agrave;o v&agrave; ra khỏi</strong> một quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u trong năm 2009.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wmk3dZXiDoqdEfxqjGzlJd9Ig5g\">Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; dạng pie charts kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sự thay đổi theo thời gian, n&ecirc;n overview ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh n&ecirc;n tập trung v&agrave;o:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K16Fdf8UloP4yQxweAylhAz5gbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[So s&aacute;nh - Lớn nhất]: </strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WoM2dh8XWoR1gix8se4lTbk9gWe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nhập cư: </strong>accompany/family chiếm tỷ lệ cao nhất (25%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZkTFdAMz8oXTKvxzJUFl6pQKgbz\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Xuất cư:</strong> definite job chiếm tỷ lệ cao nhất (36%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng ph&acirc;n chia 2 đoạn BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEbNd18N4ojAdxx5thflzyGzgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc5xdHMPYoJaUGxb6Anl93JHgob\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể chia BODY theo nh&oacute;m l&yacute; do:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E34tdYl7Gomh4oxcRxmlNKWPgJb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 1]: </strong>C&aacute;c l&yacute; do li&ecirc;n quan đến c&ocirc;ng việc v&agrave; học tập (definite job, look for job, study)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMcmdhz8foq0jTxK1jllFSmWg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 2]: </strong>C&aacute;c l&yacute; do c&ograve;n lại (accompany/family, other reasons, no reason)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DAswdbJufopgIVxgxgRlJgviglg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>:</span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jrz3dl2aSoVp8dxaOlzlEFfSgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ definite job giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (23% vs 36%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DtY2dcxesoIhKMxJGV4l6eWegtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ look for job giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (15% vs 15%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZoTkdjBPqoX8kzxUn9klL720gid\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ study giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (15% vs 7%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WkgOd0JPFoTqgSxkirVl6aOEgjg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>:</span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QrkOd5iPKoUKF3xn0uqlrvGtgSb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ accompany/family giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (25% vs 15%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-STXCdkHlooPVTMxsSbslGsfEgfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ other reasons giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (15% vs 23%)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XIMMduZNaoGOC0xXRPXlAAGig5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ no reason giữa 2 nh&oacute;m (7% vs 4%)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"190;225;411\"><colgroup><col width=\"190\"><col width=\"225\"><col width=\"411\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MojsdlnbkoneUlxJ1W8lz5ltgcc\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmG7dhDmzoNGtCxV6FOlmnVzgvd\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XL8odB47Lo193CxReaDllDd3ggc\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGuDduQdzoRMecx4ZEqlqpGqgEq\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ giữa 2 nh&oacute;m</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XeRnddXyToIMOVx23ozlT7gMgpe\">X% of emigrants..., compared to Y% of immigrants...</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXnsdAF6zoGtnXxa5bGloEoSgUb\">38% of emigrants were hired abroad, compared to 23% of immigrants.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlEKdlRKKoKyQ2xsAVRlTP7gg3g\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Diễn đạt sự tương đồng</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UBjideNy3olZpFx3RHql1hMGgTe\">The percentage was relatively similar for both groups, at around X%.</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GR0bdtr5VoYoLSxjHKil5EVggFg\">The job-search category was relatively similar for both groups, at around 15%.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CN9PdGBuGoQbHBxgjyDllR9DgXf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JqWrd0ODfo0bPyxE6tTloSyvgZg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QHXvds0REo7jaKxt3I0ls61Zgeb\">The percentage of X was double that of Y...</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y1M1dwEL6oLw1dxzo1Blo0i2gXe\">The percentage of those immigrating for studies was more than double that of emigrants.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"4\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZhvVduf7XoJW5Jxx9tVlnej3gKg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Diễn đạt tỷ lệ nhỏ nhất</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MFIWd2xFvo1hHPxiBsMlhDM6gJg\">Only X% of [group]..., making this the smallest percentage...</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q3HIdBmqsoxW68xun8flaBVtgMe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Only 7% and 4% of immigrants and emigrants relocated without any specific reason, making these the smallest percentages.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 281,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EIfLdCsSfoWvGUxFJ8ClvmUugPc\">The pie charts give information about the proportions of migrants entering and leaving a European country in 2009 for various reasons.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13718,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 282,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, it can be seen that the most common reason for immigrants going to this country was to accompany their family members, while emigrants left it to pursue offers of employment abroad.</p>",
            "question_id": 13718,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 283,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DTgsd5cSroj7sKxxM4MlPuh3gxc\">Regarding job- and study-related purposes, 36% of emigrants from the country were hired abroad, nearly double the corresponding percentage for immigrants to the country, which stood at 23%. Meanwhile, the job-search category was relatively similar for both immigrants and emigrants, accounting for 15% and 13% respectively. In contrast, the percentage of those immigrating for their studies was more than double that of emigrants, with their respective figures standing at 15% and 7%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13718,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 284,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAhqdxro1oF07VxFFOylLC9lgQc\">As for the other reasons, exactly a quarter of immigrants went to this country to reunite with their families, compared to 15% of emigrants with the same purpose. Other, undisclosed reasons constituted significant proportions in both groups, accounting for 15% and 23% of migrants to and from this nation. Finally, only 7% and 4% of immigrants and emigrants relocated without any specific reason, making these percentages the smallest figures in the charts.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13718,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
